{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_923.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"b8b0a6eb2b8b47920b135e468c5cf73758933ce3728b26cd581c60ee818a6746","ja":"苦手コクフク特訓～結果編～","zh":"苦手克服特训～结果篇～","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_923.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"7ccaacaa50359c9136255c998cd903e2b46bce3db2595c7471ebdf3ed29e0bbd","ja":"雪歩ちゃん、怖いなら無理しなくても……。\nあら、どうかしたの？","zh":"雪步，要是害怕的话，不勉强自己也没关系……\n哎呀，怎么了？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_923.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2a6d85fda511a82e07c3c5170c90b92c7b5f7f48a4c0a3453877f23512f163c0","ja":"はい……。部屋の隅にいるワンちゃん、\nずっとあそこで寝てるなって思って……。","zh":"是的……我在想，房间角落里的小狗，一直都在那儿睡觉呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_923.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"3f3fdab1d8e9531d1c51bc74b40369eb8c836526e936e9bf131fbc5778fd4e27","ja":"そういえば、寝るのが好きな子がいるって、\n店員さんが言ってたわ。もしかしたら、あの子かも。","zh":"说起来，店员提到过，有个喜欢睡觉的孩子。说不定就是那孩子。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_923.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"8092f44c38f6243aac9b49992a7e92c84d39d7b615fafa13ea9bbefe061c6108","ja":"そうなんですね……。","zh":"原来是这样……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_923.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"075578319cfba67c8dcb5b9dedadb26c7c8fc7e7067ba9de37fc284e57ec6ef2","ja":"…………。莉緒さん、触るのはまだ怖いですけど、\nちょっと近づくだけなら……できるかも！","zh":"…………。莉绪小姐，虽然我还是害怕触摸，但只是稍微靠近一点的话……或许可以做到！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_923.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"c6fc5097d39ff1d95ba4e97b903f5facf0190d6d80b921c8f69968fe3ca8a79a","ja":"雪歩ちゃん……！　そう、その意気よ！\n少しずつでいいの。勇気をだして！","zh":"雪步……！对，就是这股劲头！\n一点一点来也没关系。鼓起勇气来！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_923.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"6654fba03e43e2215ec725a2ce8c2ea6d949ecf62feefdc68b9fa9f5eb4608e8","ja":"フレーフレー、ゆーきーぴょん☆","zh":"加油加油，小有纪☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_923.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"9a65d2dc8d69a33e6d638cf588b5b685638c626476faa16ece1be3f19b43787f","ja":"頑張れ、雪歩ちゃん！\nゆっくり近づけば、きっと大丈夫！","zh":"加油，雪步！\n慢慢靠近的话，一定没问题！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_923.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"52be5674690c8d94294651d7bb74127db9370b9f93b969546e78252c9e3e75b9","ja":"う、うん。やってみる！","zh":"呃、嗯。我试试看！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_923.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"24d028d43c41080ee4c0e1978cc98b539a4ca0a7d60eb993fb28c0da6fc5f152","ja":"うぅ……こ、怖いよぉ……。\nでも、少しなら……えーい！","zh":"呜呜……好、好可怕啊……。\n不过，就一点点的话……嘿——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_923.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"970606df9de3ee3d56f4ee49cdda7473c9d5e7c28ff663e7b271c695475c21ca","ja":"や、やった～！\n一歩だけ近づくことができました！","zh":"太、太好了～！\n向前迈进了一步！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_923.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"f5bcbdec89e154e960081f03d0899175d1a2f9159908a8514dc936a415cad64f","ja":"すごいじゃない、雪歩ちゃん♪\n今はそれで十分よ！　おめでとう！","zh":"这不是很厉害嘛，小雪♪\n现在这样就已经足够了！恭喜！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_923.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"fca14443ac74d414d42fc84943baa1476b5178745eb31c75531f60d779534471","ja":"は、はい……！　ありがとうございますぅ！\n本番もこの調子で頑張りますね！","zh":"是、是的……！谢谢您！\n正式演出我也会照这个状态加油的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_923.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"2e4e1d9008c48b6acfe095dc50917d7c7ab338e080f1d50f0a768d7015a65651","ja":"―収録当日―","zh":"——录制当天——","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_923.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"c3745e8e30044b5d4694635645e02285dbca2a845a1aea1a74e8f46e55280b0c","ja":"（ド、ドキドキするよぉ。でも特訓したんだから……。\n……わわ！　子犬がいっぱい出てきた……！）","zh":"（好、好紧张啊……可是都特训过了……。……哇哇！好多小狗跑出来了……！）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_923.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"92471e3ae112649c2afe4802b610c08827d7da526f63caca5a7e25bb83c3fb09","ja":"（あれ？　なんかみんなすっごく元気……ハッ！\nそういえば、寝てる子がいるなんて限らないかも……）","zh":"（咦？怎么感觉大家都特别有精神……啊！这么说来，也不一定会有睡着的孩子……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_923.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"e4168b1071dabe6b0977226e580e38aa5574c1cce8b4d5112b510808885cc0c5","ja":"はぅ～～～！！　ご、ごめんなさいー！\nわ、私、やっぱり無理ですぅ～！","zh":"呜～～～！！对、对不起——！\n我、我果然还是做不到～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_923.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"727b8e81e27ca0d84a273940e679a1b0d4df8fd0cf01de38de54052874f28e35","ja":"ち、ちょっと雪歩ちゃん、大丈夫～！？","zh":"等、等一下，雪步，没事吧～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
